@startuml
title Fig 2.6: UC #3 Activity Diagram - Place an Order
footer Author: Nguyen Phan Anh Tuan (524H0135)

|Customer|
start
:Select Delivery Address & click Checkout;

|OFDH System|
:Calculate distance from Hub to Address;
if (distance <= 7.0 km?) then (No)
  :Show "Out of delivery range" error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

:Check Hub active orders (Placed/Confirmed/Preparing);
if (activeOrders >= 25?) then (Yes - Busy)
  :Block selected Hub & find nearby Hub < 50% load;
  |Customer|
  if (Switch to suggested Quiet Hub for 5% discount?) then (Yes)
    |OFDH System|
    :Assign Quiet Hub & apply 5% incentive;
  else (No)
    :Abort checkout;
    stop
  endif
else (No - Available)
  :Keep selected Hub;
endif

:Compute distance fee (15k + 5k/km rounded 0.5 km);
|Customer|
if (Enter promotional Voucher?) then (Yes)
  |OFDH System|
  if (Valid & max 1 voucher?) then (Yes)
    :Apply voucher discount (<= food subtotal);
  else (No)
    :Display voucher error message;
  endif
endif

|Customer|
:Select Payment Method & click Confirm Order;
|OFDH System|
if (Tourist & COD > 500,000 VND?) then (Yes)
  :Block COD & request Int'l Card;
  stop
else (No)
endif

if (Online Payment?) then (Yes)
  :Authorize via Payment Gateway;
  if (Authorized?) then (No)
    :Notify payment failed;
    stop
  endif
endif

:Atomically save Order [Placed], LineItems, Payment;
:Increment Hub activeOrders & Voucher usedCount;
:Notify Hub Kitchen & show digital receipt;
stop
@enduml